NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000298 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000299 "=head1 AUTHOR"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000300 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000301 "perlancar <perlancar@cpan.org>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000302 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000303 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000304 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000305 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000306 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000307 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000308 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000309 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000310 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000311 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000312 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000313 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000314 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000315 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000316 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000317 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000318 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000319 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000320 ""
